    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section 7 of the LandAcquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude which is required fora public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
